r character! She is a villainess! There are two versions in the drive link, you can choose which one you prefer to draw! One is her villainess form and one is her undercover form. \n\nYou can choose the pose and expression. You can draw her in modern situations as well! I will use the illustration on social media, youtube, and twitch.\n\nAs a Villainess she is cruel, slightly crazy, but still protective of her ruined kingdom and throne. But she can be flustered and shy when she is embarrassed! Sometimes she is a bit silly. She can use shadow magic.\n\nIn her undercover form she is hiding in the modern-day world and enjoys reading villainess isekai comics, drinking coffee, and cooking. She gives off a calm feeling but she's still a villainess at heart!\n\nImportant design notes: She does not have human ears. She does not have a tail.\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Gho4ZgPZntzqhR0AgjrJN0g_DXsyUITr?usp=drive_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 690667, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "さかな狸@nEco!Drive!", "screen_name": "cx5titaozi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1897850566380077056/Fwj404X9.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/766211943170441216/1724588767/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 40, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 48}, {"id": 993483, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "木犀", "screen_name": "mokusei0516", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1717418282679242752/kNfpaaa7.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1334448316436762624/1696083071/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "po